ements or delivery acknowledgements. Addresses #434.\n\nAfter promoting snapshot-capable code to all dashboard writers and completing the documented paused-writer cutover, enable it with:\n\n```sh\ngh variable set DATA_BRANCH_SNAPSHOTS --body true --repo open-telemetry/shared-workflows\n```\n\nEach generated branch then retains one complete, parentless snapshot. Explicit push leases prevent stale workers from overwriting accepted updates, and snapshot generations prevent stale fetches from rolling state backward.\n\nActivation defaults to disabled. The cutover procedure includes an external backup, tree verification, and recovery guidance. Existing clones do not shrink automatically, and other refs to old data can retain history.\n\nRefresh schedules and the stalled-run watchdog remain unchanged.","title":"Add snapshot-only storage for generated data branches"},"mode":"publish","pr":436,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791828990,"generation":2,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"b2c5d10a25df4886b239c0922db1e32f","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/shared-workflows","repo_id":1279488627,"request_id":"b9aa09e1a2574c4da975b22378e8904f","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/bb68514826ed27b756023e196d2f92f7e88fa58a","workflow_revision":"bb68514826ed27b756023e196d2f92f7e88fa58a"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":38289843121,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/38289843121"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":[],"seen_inline_findings":[],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"publish_pending","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38291782242}}